2) PHP-FPM pool + OPcache (upload 3 GB)


Với 32 GB, đặt trước: pm.max_children = 110 (dành ~12 GB cho PHP).
Sau khi chạy thật, bạn đo lại MB/process để tinh chỉnh.
=========================================================================================================================


cat >/etc/php/8.1/fpm/pool.d/www.conf <<'EOF'
[www]
user = elnda_eaut_e_usr
group = elnda_eaut_e_usr
listen = /run/php/php8.1-fpm.sock

pm = dynamic
pm.max_children = 110
pm.start_servers = 20
pm.min_spare_servers = 20
pm.max_spare_servers = 40
pm.max_requests = 500
request_terminate_timeout = 300s
pm.status_path = /fpm-status

; Giới hạn lớn (upload 3GB)
php_admin_value[memory_limit] = 512M
php_admin_value[upload_max_filesize] = 3072M
php_admin_value[post_max_size] = 3072M
php_admin_value[max_execution_time] = 300
EOF


=========================================================================================================================
OPcache (rất quan trọng):
=========================================================================================================================

cat >/etc/php/8.1/fpm/conf.d/10-opcache.ini <<'EOF'
opcache.enable=1
opcache.enable_cli=0
opcache.memory_consumption=512
opcache.interned_strings_buffer=64
opcache.max_accelerated_files=65000
opcache.validate_timestamps=1
opcache.revalidate_freq=60
opcache.jit=1255
opcache.jit_buffer_size=256M
EOF

systemctl restart php8.1-fpm

=========================================================================================================================

Tinh lại pm.max_children sau khi có tải:
ps -o rss= -C php-fpm8.1 | awk '{s+=$1} END{if(NR)print "Avg_MB="int((s/NR)/1024)}'
pm.max_children ≈ (RAM_cho_PHP_MB)/(Avg_MB) (ví dụ 12288/110 ≈ 110).

